config BR2_PACKAGE_DCONF
	bool "dconf"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_LIBGLIB2
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_DBUS
	help
	  The GSettings backend GNOME, Pop!_OS and Ubuntu ship: a GIO
	  module (libdconfsettings.so), the D-Bus activated dconf-service
	  that applies every write in order, and the dconf CLI. Without
	  it GLib falls back to its keyfile backend, where each writer
	  rewrites the whole file and concurrent writes lose each other
	  (cosmic-settings-daemon writes its GNOME keys as concurrent
	  `gsettings set` processes).

	  https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/dconf
